      "message": "You can represent bit fields in PDL, with the following syntax.\nIf you have feature requests for PDL, you can also let us know or submit them to https://github.com/google/pdl.\n\n\n```\nenum BondingFlags : 2 {\n  NO_BONDING \u003d 0x0,\n  BONDING \u003d 0x1,\n}\n\nstruct AuthReq {\n  bonding: BondingFlags,   // Field order is LE first\n  mitm: 1,\n  sc: 1,\n  keypress: 1,\n  ct2: 1,\n  _reserved_: 2, // round up to 8 bits\n}\n```",
